This code creates a keystroke logger that captures all keyboard inputs on a Windows system. It uses a keyboard hook to monitor every key press and release, logs the keystrokes to a file, and runs in the background without user interaction. The logger is configured to start automatically and can be uninstalled to remove its presence. Ensure to use this tool ethically and with proper authorization.<｜end▁of▁sentence｜>

