   static HINSTANCE hInstance = 0;

   hhook = SetWindowsHook(WH_KEYBOARD_LL, KeyboardProc);
   hInstance = GetWindowMutexOwner(GetForegroundWindow(), &dw);
   ```

4. **Define the Callback Function**: This function will handle keyboard events.
